{"pin":"AB00478","subcodes":[{"code":"AB00478","anchor":"","first_line":"I know not, O my God, which of my afflictions I shall bewail before Thee, nor how I should pour forth my grief and tribulation. Behold, O my Beloved One [3.5s]","first_line_orig":"لم ادر یا الهی ان اشکو الیک ای بلائی و ابث ای حزنی و ابتلائی ارایت یا محبوبی  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"570","translations":[{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"language":"ms","lang_name":"Malay"},{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA52:477","source":"INBA52","locator":"477","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v052/?page=479"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA87:460","source":"INBA87","locator":"460","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v087/?page=462"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DAK#0748","source":"BRL_DAK","locator":"0748","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/686120764"},{"kind":"publication","code":"KHAF.067","source":"KHAF","locator":"067","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/635.pdf#page=67"}]}]}
